Package: supplement
Title: Supplemental Materials Websites with 'Quarto'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jeffrey M.", "Girard", , "jmgirard@ku.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7359-3746"))
Description: Provides a 'Quarto' website template for sharing the
    supplemental materials of a research paper: analysis reports, code,
    and open data. Every report renders as a page of one site, and stored
    computation output lets the site rebuild without the data. The site is
    served by 'GitHub Pages', and each release can be archived on 'Zenodo'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/jmgirard/supplement
BugReports: https://github.com/jmgirard/supplement/issues
Imports:
    cli,
    jsonlite,
    yaml
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Quarto command-line interface (tested with 1.10)
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
